        "denialFound": "No denial. KPMG was asked. BS writes that the firm said \"in response to Business Standard's queries\": \"With regards to the IDBI bank sale, DIPAM is running the process for selecting a transaction advisor. Hence we would refrain from commenting on the ongoing process.\" (https://www.business-standard.com/article/economy-policy/kpmg-to-assist-government-in-strategic-divestment-of-idbi-bank-for-rs-1-121082600542_1.html). This is a refusal to comment, not a denial or a confirmation. I found no DIPAM statement: the web search budget was used up, and direct attempts to reach DIPAM, PIB and search-engine pages returned nothing relevant.",
