        "denialFound": "None found. Not asked, and no response is needed: the claim accuses Rothschild & Co of nothing. The firm's own India page (https://www.rothschildandco.com/en/countries/india/) describes itself as providing \"M&A and Strategic Advisory, Global Markets Solutions including fundraising and strategic capital...\" and mentions no banking licence. That is a self-description, not a denial.",
