        "denialFound": "none found, not asked. There is nothing to deny because the source makes no lobbying allegation. Government's stated rationale, in the BDO/Telegraph piece: the backlog of about 600 pending applications, ease of doing business and manufacturing investment. DPIIT Secretary Amardeep Singh Bhatia and JS Shivahare are quoted (https://www.bdo.in/en-gb/news/2026/india-eases-fdi-rules-under-press-note-3-with-10-per-cent-cap-for-border-country-investors).",
